<title>SRI LANKA: Richard Pieris up on bonus news.</title>
<headline>Richard Pieris up on bonus news.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Richard Pieris &amp; Co Ltd rose 2.2 percent or 2.75 rupees to 127.75 in early Wednesday trade, following a bonus announcement by the company, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The bonus issue of one for six announced earlier, is having a positive impact on the share,&quot; said a broker who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
